 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tires",
   "text": "All tires observed were matched by brand \"American Classic\" and had tread depths of 14/32nds at the front and 11/32nds at the rear. Spare tire is present during the inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The exterior of the vehicle was dusty at time of inspection. This can hide minor imperfections. There are minor misc scratches around the vehicle. Normal for mileage and most too small to see in photos. The paint shows some wear and tear that is consistent with age and mileage. The underside shows areas of surface rust. The exterior lights, windshield wipers, and washer functioned properly. Window and door seals are intact."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. Seat smudges observed. The inner door panels show wear consistent with age and mileage. The interior trim shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The center console shows wear and tear. I tested the seat features throughout the vehicle and they all functioned properly. The vehicle was not smoked in and I noted no unusual odors. The climate controls and interior electronic systems worked as designed. I noted that the windows, locks, mirrors, and gauges operated properly."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "Due to the vehicle having a sealed transmission unit, I was unable to check the level or condition of the transmission fluid. The exhaust system shows some surface rust, but at this time has no audible leaks. Vehicle's emission label was present. All accessible fluids were checked and are at normal operating levels. All hoses were intact with no visible leaks in engine bay or under vehicle."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "I hooked up my scanner and found no fault codes. The vehicle started and idled normally. I test-drove the vehicle and the ride, acceleration, and handling felt normal. The engine was smooth and responsive. The transmission worked as designed without issues and the brakes exhibited firmness, with no noticeable pulsation."
  }
 ],
